msgid ""
"<qt><p>No URL configured for uploading your free/busy list. Please set it in "
"KOrganizer's configuration dialog, on the \"Free/Busy\" page.</p><p>Contact "
"your system administrator for the exact URL and the account details.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><p>Keen URL för't Hoochladen vun Dien Free-/Bunnenlist angeven. Giff ehr "
"bitte binnen de KOrganizer-Instellen op de \"Free/Bunnen\"-Siet an.</"
"p><p>Fraag Dien Systeempleger na de naue URL un de Konto-Enkelheiten.</p></"
"qt>"

